;- API design only — no callable functions are implemented in this module yet.
  Proposed functions:
      encoding.utf8Valid(text)
      encoding.utf8Length(text)
      encoding.base64Encode(bytes)
      encoding.base64Decode(text)
      encoding.hexEncode(bytes)
      encoding.hexDecode(text)

  The current NUL-terminated string representation cannot store arbitrary binary data
  with embedded zero bytes. Define a length-bearing byte buffer before adding byte APIs. -;
